WEBVTT

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.430
How are you, Yayoi?

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.850
I'm very good, Kanako.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.400
I see. I'm happy to hear that.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.320
I read another fascinating book.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.030
My, what was it called?

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.780
Well... Oh, I've forgotten the title.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.280
Will you tell me what kind of story it was?

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.150
Yes, gladly.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.920
It was a story of love and friendship between gentlemen,

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:34.010
a tale silently spoken by the passionate hearts of men to their trusted companions in battle.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.340
They overcome many obstacles, carrying within their hearts:

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.980
justice, truth, and miraculous love, as they clash with one another

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.640
and invite those who watch them into a spectacular world...

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.400
My, what a heartwarming story.

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:52.240
The young midfielder in the book had a phrase he would always say.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.260
What is it? Tell me.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.980
The ball is my friend. I'm not scar-

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:31.630
There's something I'm hiding from everyone.

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:35.530
I don't think it's something anyone else would care about,

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:39.090
but it's far too late to tell them the secret.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.090
Oh, no!

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:47.580
The Secret Garden

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:51.860
Good morning.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:53.890
You're late, Jun.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:55.470
Sorry. I'll change right away!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.820
Men's Dressing Room

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.730
Arashi-san, be more careful.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:12.320
I'm sorry, Hajime-chan.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.950
I thought I left the burner on.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.840
Oh, Kamigamo.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.420
You just get here?

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.360
Welcome.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.620
Please, choose whichever seat you like.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:43.720
Kaya, that outfit looks great on you.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.040
You think?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.190
Yeah, it's pretty.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.420
This place hasn't changed.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:52.790
Yeah, it was never bombed,

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.330
so I was here this whole time.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:00.570
Arashi-san's also pretty, but Kaya-san has a nice, exotic feel to her...

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:02.940
You're as perverted as always.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.660
Are you still mad?

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:07.830
You're a guy. Don't be pissed off because someone saw you changing.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.100
You're too inconsiderate.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.190
And you're making too big a deal out of it, Kamigamo.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.660
You sure you're not actually a chick?

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:18.050
Wh-What makes you say that?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:22.900
If you're a guy, you need to get more exercise. Your chest is all flat and soft...

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.310
Table two needs an iced coffee.

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:32.690
OK!

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.880
He really is inconsiderate...

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:37.860
Huh?

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.330
It's acting weird today.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.280
Since I didn't buy it, I guess I can't complain.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.270
Salt, please.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.360
What's wrong, Kamigamo?

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.730
The salt, please.

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:10.540
Jeez, you're a man. Buck up a bit.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:13.960
Did you know that if you splash a cockroach with detergent, it'll die?

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.240
Right! Here I go!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.000
Three!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:20.670
Two!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:21.300
One!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.080
Zero!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.460
Get ready...

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.920
Fire!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.550
Excuse me, the salt?

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:45.660
Sorry, we were out of detergent.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.650
<i>Yasaka!</i>

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.770
Why's he such an idiot?

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.100
He's such a jerk!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.240
Such a kid!

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:00.610
In everything he says and does!

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:03.340
I put a change of clothes here for you.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.070
OK, thanks.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:11.310
I know guys are all a bunch of children, but with Yasaka, it's too much!

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:13.380
He needs to think of others more!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.440
Hey, Jun!

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.720
We're packed. Hurry up!

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:19.680
OK, I'll be right there!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.330
I'm back.

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:26.200
Hey, that outfit...

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.660
Huh? What?

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.570
What the heck?

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:35.710
Jun-kun, you're cute.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:38.970
Wh-Wh-Wh-What is this?!

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:40.500
What do you mean?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.540
It's our uniform.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.540
This is for girls!

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.460
Pay attention when you're getting dressed.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.530
I was thinking about something!

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.670
I don't have any spare male uniforms.

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.270
Please deal with it for today.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.910
I'm changing into my own clothes.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:54.190
No way.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.390
The place needs a certain atmosphere, right?

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.950
And cross-dressing's part of that?

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:00.610
It's fine as long as nobody knows.

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:02.100
No way!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:07.060
Hm... Let's add your tardiness today to what Yasaka lost in his bet,

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:10.240
plus the cost of the plates you broke, water for the bath,

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.500
and the clean-up time, divided by your hourly salary...

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.480
Anything else?

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:14.630
The milk he spilled.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.150
Oh, I forgot about that.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:17.560
I guess this is it?

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:20.150
OK, thanks!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.280
You're pretty cute.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.670
Um, thank you.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.740
You just start here?

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.300
Um, kinda...

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.960
Want to exchange cellphone email addresses?

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:35.750
Sorry, it's against the shop rules.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.110
Hey, would you take my order, too?

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:39.930
OK, I'll be right over!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.890
Man, he's pretty popular.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:44.800
He might draw a lot of customers.

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:45.870
Yeah.

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:49.050
He's more attractive as a woman than you.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:50.650
What?

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:55.050
Jun, do you have a moment?

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:56.830
What is it, Kaya-san?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.740
You should let your dress down a bit more.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.250
Let my dress down?

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:06.030
When you put on a kimono, you let the neck down about the length of a fist, to show your neck.

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.330
There, this looks better.

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:10.630
Um, thank you.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:13.840
A girl must know how to wear a kimono properly.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.590
Yes...

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.010
But, I'm a guy!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.380
Table five, iced tea with milk.

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:22.320
Got it!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.520
Jeez...

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:32.150
Please pass the salt.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:39.160
Again, seriously?

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:43.610
Don't worry, this one's fresh.

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:44.750
Right! Here I go!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:45.900
Three!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.670
Two!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.380
One...

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.200
Excuse me, the salt...

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:00.810
What?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.260
It doesn't work on rats?

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.270
<i>Yasaka!</i>

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.950
I can't believe it! I can't believe it! I can't believe it!

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:14.370
He's such an idiot!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:19.290
Putting detergent on a rat is only gonna give it a good shampoo!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.780
He doesn't even know that?

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:23.770
Hey, Jun! You not done yet?

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.540
Yeah, be right there.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.910
Thanks for waiting.

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.730
What?

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.810
Wow. Jun-chan, you're so cute.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:42.460
What the hell is this?

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:43.980
Can't you tell?

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:44.900
It's a maid uniform.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:46.520
This isn't men's clothing!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.740
So, pay attention when you're getting dressed.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.360
I told you, I was thinking!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:56.350
I don't have any spares, so I dragged out a uniform I was thinking of using when I first opened.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:57.460
Thinking of using?

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.210
I see.

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.660
I was certain that was actually yours.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.080
Oh, it is.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.820
Let me wear my normal clothes, please.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:14.460
Let's see... What you had, what was just added, plus all the various interest...

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.850
OK, get to work!

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.470
What?

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:24.540
You know, if you had boobs, you'd really be a girl.

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:29.760
N-No way...

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:44.700
How are you, Yayoi?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.070
I'm very good, Kanako.

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.610
I see. I'm happy to hear that.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:52.590
I read another fascinating book.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:55.250
My, what was it called?

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:59.000
Well... Oh, I've forgotten the title.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.500
Will you tell me what kind of story it was?

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.410
Yes, gladly.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:08.420
It was a story of love and friendship between gentlemen,

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:13.620
a tale silently spoken by the passionate hearts of men to their trusted companions in battle.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:17.070
They overcome many obstacles, carrying within their hearts:

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.010
justice, truth, and miraculous love, as they clash with one another

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:24.610
and invite those who watch them into a spectacular world.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.870
My, what a heartwarming story.

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:30.780
And the swordsman in the book had a phrase he would always say.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.400
Oh, tell me.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.470
Hiten Mitsurugi Style-

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:40.210
Hey, when do you get off work?

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.520
Um, I work until closing.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:44.490
Where's your school? Is it close?

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.540
No, I come by train...

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:49.100
Jun-kun's so cute!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.130
He's even more popular now.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:53.010
And our sales have gone up a lot, too.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.520
We can use this!

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.320
Why do I have to do this?

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:03.070
Hey, Jun, be nicer to the customers.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:03.970
Huh?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:06.180
Be more sexy.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.440
And make them spend more money.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:12.010
I don't like putting myself forward like that!

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:12.770
Huh?

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.660
You're not getting it.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.370
Just like this!

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:22.690
But I guess, since it's just you in a maid uniform, there's no real sexiness.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:24.800
Why, you-

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:28.800
Oh, well. If we can't win with quality, we'll have to try quantity.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:35.400
A monster...

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.520
I'm looking at a monster.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.240
You look really terrible in that.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:41.070
This is unusable.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.410
Not even worth the thought.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:44.590
You could've told me that before I put this on!

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:49.430
Master, there's someone more suited to wear that than Hajime-chan, isn't there?

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.530
See.

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:56.180
Welcome back, Master.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.880
Would you like to order?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.410
Or would you like a bath?

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.750
Or perhaps me?

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:05.820
You can kind of see the evil lurking behind her smile, can't you?

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.040
What?!

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.130
I guess her personality won't work.

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:11.590
It works fine!

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:16.350
Don't force yourself. Can't Arashi-san or Kaya-san wear it?

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:21.760
Hi!

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.480
Well, Hajime-chan?

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.910
Awesome, Arashi-san!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.490
You, too, Kaya.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:31.230
I don't want to go out in public in this...

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:37.580
What are you gonna do, Jun?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.380
You're losing.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.510
I don't care if I lose!

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:42.530
What?

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:46.010
A man has to do his best in any kind of challenge.

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:50.720
Here, the manly thing to do
is being womanly to beat them!

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:51.990
Which now?

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.160
Detective Agency

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:02.240
Now then, our next experiment is a volcano, using soda and candy!

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.610
If you put mint candy into carbonated soda,

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:07.670
they say that it'll explode. Is that true?

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:10.230
Let's find out.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.040
This is very dangerous. Please don't try it at home.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:33.270
No change.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.710
Thank you.

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:39.720
Jun-kun's a perfect lady now, isn't he?

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:43.540
She was really good in that home movie, as well.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:46.390
She's got a talent for acting...

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:48.720
I'm good at acting, too.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:53.680
I used to get all kinds of rings, cars, condominiums with it.

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:56.340
Huh? What are you doing, Kaya?

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.560
Ah... I'm...

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.750
Get out on the floor to help customers, Kaya.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:04.000
Ah, I can't show my legs in front of others.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.820
Get rid of your old-fashioned morals.

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:09.100
You don't come from the war era or anything.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:11.980
She was born old-fashioned.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.660
Oh, fine.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.230
Then, handle the register.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:21.470
That's 2000 yen. Here's 310 back.

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:22.190
Wait.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:23.970
Hey, Kaya.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:28.240
Do you know why they gave you a bill instead of change?

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.080
Why is it?

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:35.000
They want you to give them the change with that hand of yours.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:40.760
The one time a waitress can legally be touched is during payment.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:43.460
That's your best chance for extra service!

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:49.270
Hold the money in your right hand and offer it,
left hand extended, so it doesn't drop.

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:51.740
But that's just an excuse.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:54.050
Your left hand is the secret to the attack.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:58.190
The moment your hands touch is when you put the money into his hand.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:01.530
When a man pays with bills,
he's expecting that, for sure!

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:05.180
In other words, you're telling me to hold the hand of a man I don't even know?

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:08.770
You have to make it look accidental.

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:13.840
And while you're at it, smile and say, "Please come again."

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:17.240
This is what I call "Secret Technique: Palm Clasping."

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.620
It'll grab the heart of any male customer!

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.910
Come on, Kaya.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.740
Show me what you've got!

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.000
I can't do it!

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.550
Such a shameful thing...

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:37.930
Hey, hey. No guy's gonna buy you a condo this way.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.680
Please don't teach her to con people.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:43.100
I'm not. She's working to polish her feminine technique.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.570
That's not work!

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:48.150
Anyway, Kaya-san is having a horrible time.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.930
Stop making her do stuff she doesn't want to.

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:51.630
I'm not forcing her.

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:54.530
She's just holding their hand and saying, "Please come again."

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.190
Please come again.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.900
What are you doing?

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:05.740
You told me to make an effort, so I am!

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:07.890
Don't make an effort to reduce our customer base!

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:09.710
You know, guys...

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:17.640
But if you shake the hand of every customer, you may find someone you can connect with.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:21.240
That's impossible. I can't shake hands with a man, and...

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:24.540
I only connect with women.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:25.750
Rest Area

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:31.980
It's so crazy here every day.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.740
And it has been, ever since I met him...

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.270
Oh, Arashi-san!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.740
Where do you want to go next time?

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:39.830
Let's see...

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.750
There are lots of places in Hakuraku I haven't been.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:46.040
I'll go anywhere with you.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.700
You're not still...

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:48.460
Yeah.

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.280
We're going back to the war and saving people.

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.050
You sure are laid back.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:58.040
Arashi-san, you shouldn't get a kid caught up in something so dangerous.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:02.820
Hey, Kamigamo, I'm not getting "caught up in it."

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:06.180
I'm helping her of my own free will.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:10.160
I know! You try it!

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:14.120
You're a man, so you may connect with her!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:18.670
I've never connected with two guys at once.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:21.840
Let's try it, Arashi-san!

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:24.350
I-I think I'm good.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.670
Come on, don't be scared!

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:31.080
Stop. Let me go! Stop it, I said...

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.280
Don't fight so hard. We're just trying it out.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.950
Nothing happened.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.640
Jun-kun and I don't connect, I guess.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.380
<i>Idiot!</i>

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:02.770
An agent needs more than just raw talent.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.200
Ark

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:07.160
He keeps doing that awful stuff because he doesn't know!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.970
He doesn't know! He doesn't know...

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:13.720
Yeah. He doesn't know, does he?

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.670
And I can't tell him right now.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:21.190
If they find out, I won't be able to go to the Ark anymore.

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:24.410
I wonder if this is selfish of me.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.190
Did you get in a fight?

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.680
Kaya-san?

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:29.380
It's nothing new.

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:30.760
Are you all right?

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:34.350
He's not a bad guy, but he's just such an idiot.

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:35.280
I see.

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:36.840
You're close, aren't you?

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.400
Not at all!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.510
You can only have fights like that when you're close.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:43.360
Just like me and Arashi.

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:44.640
Kaya-san...

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:47.630
Thank you for helping me back there.

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:51.030
I'm not used to dealing with men.

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:54.240
It's a problem being too used to it, like the master.

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:59.860
Yeah, maybe you understand a maiden's heart better.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:02.750
A boy's heart is the same, I'm sure.

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.730
You need to not hit so hard, you know?

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:08.940
Screw you.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.400
It's your fault.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.770
What did you say?!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.230
Stop it, Hajime-chan.

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:16.660
Man, we sold a ton today.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.070
Maybe we'll all wear maid outfits from now on.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.450
I'm not wearing women's clothes anymore.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:24.420
Oh, come on. Don't be a stick in the mud!

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.140
I'll wear them!

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.410
The hell you will.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:31.640
A cola for table two.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:32.830
OK!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.450
Again?

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:38.420
Jeez...

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.610
Ark

00:22:33.530 --> 00:22:35.580
How are you, Yayoi?

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:37.960
I'm very good, Kanako.

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:40.500
I see. I'm happy to hear that.

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:43.470
I read another fascinating book.

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:46.120
My, what was it called?

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:49.870
Well... Oh, I've forgotten the title.

00:22:49.870 --> 00:22:52.390
Will you tell me what kind of story it was?

00:22:52.390 --> 00:22:54.290
Yes, gladly.

00:22:55.130 --> 00:22:59.510
It was a story of love and friendship between gentlemen,

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:04.550
a tale silently spoken by the passionate hearts of men to their trusted companions in battle.

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:08.540
They overcome many obstacles, carrying within their hearts:

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:11.380
justice, truth, and miraculous love, as they clash with one another

00:23:11.380 --> 00:23:15.600
and invite those who watch them into a spectacular world...

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:18.700
My, what a heartwarming story.

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:22.790
And the young sou-uke in the book had a phrase he would always say.

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:25.350
[Note: A Sou-uke is a character that is perceived to be easily emotionally dominated and is often the "bottom" half of the relationship in yaoi doujinshi.]

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:25.350
What is it? Tell me.

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:27.910
Pegasus Meteor Fis-

00:23:30.910 --> 00:23:32.360
When you think of summer, you think of-

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:33.740
Mosquito incense?

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:36.190
Those pigs are cute, aren't they?

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:39.140
But is the hole where the smoke comes out their mouth?

00:23:39.140 --> 00:23:39.970
Or maybe their nose?

00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:41.110
It comes out their ass, too!

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:42.390
Watch your filthy mouth.

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:44.940
Get up bright and early tomorrow!

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:50.140
<i>Get up bright and early tomorrow!</i>

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:50.240
Illustration by Hinase Momoyama
